<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id">Joel</book>
  <para style="h">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joel</para>
  <para style="mt">Joel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pethuela fapa Joela hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Putarte u, hei hi hre rawh u, he rama awm zawng zawngte u, beng chhi rawh u. Hei hi in hun lai leh in pute hun lai pawhin a awm tawh ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu chu in fate hrilh ula, in fate chuan an fate hrilh sela, an fa lehte chuan chhuan dang hrilh zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thingngêt pangangin a ei bân apiang chu khaukhuapin a ei a; khaukhuapin a ei bân apiang chu thingngêtin a ei a, thingngêtin a ei bân apiang chu pangangin a ei zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruite u, harh ula, ṭap rawh u; uain in zawng zawngte u, a uain thlum avâng chuan chiau vak vak rawh u; in kâ ata lâk bo a ni tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam chak tak, chhiar sên loh ka ramah an lo chhuak ta si a, an ha chu sakeibaknei ha ang a ni a, sakeibaknei lian tak hapui ang an nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka grêp hrui a tichhia a, ka theipui thing pil a hîk a; a hîk fai vek a, a paih bo va; a ṭangte chu a filh vâr vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nulain saiip puan fênga a ṭhat lai pasal a sûn angin ṭap vak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhangphut hlan te, in tûr hlante chu Lalpa in ata tihbo a ni a; puithiam, Lalpa rawngbâwltute chu an lungngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lo chu tihchhiat a ni a, ram chu a lungngai a; buh chu tihchhiat a ni a, uain thar chu a kang a, hriak chu a chau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw, nangni lo neitute u, zak ula; aw nangni, grêp hrui enkawltute u, buh leh buhsanghar avângin chiau vak vak rawh u; lova buh seng tûr chu a boral ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grêp hrui chu a vuai a, theipui kûng chu a chau va; pawmgranet thei kûng te, tûm te leh apple thei kûng te, lova thing zawng zawngte pawh chu a chuai ta a; mihring fate zînga lâwmna chu a vuai ral ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangni puithiamte u, saiip puan veng ula, ṭap rawh u; nangni, maichâm rawngbâwltute u, chiau vak vak rawh u; nangni ka Pathian rawngbâwltute u, lo kal ula, saiip puan sinin zankhuain mu rawh u; in Pathian in aṭang chuan chhangphut hlan leh in tûr hlan chu khap a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chaw nghei hun serh thianghlim ula, inkhâwmpui urhsûn siam ula, Lalpa in Pathian inah chuan putarte leh he rama chêng zawng zawngte chu hruai khâwm ula, Lalpa chu au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu ni chu a chung a pik e! Lalpa ni chu a hnai si a, Engkimtitheia laka boralna a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan mit hmuhah ei tûr tihbo a ni lo vem ni, a ni, kan hlimna leh kan lâwmna chu kan Pathian in ata tihbo a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chite chu lei tlang hnuaiahte chuan a ṭawih a, zêmte chu a ram a; buh inte chu ṭhiatin a awm a, a buh a vuai ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rante chu an va rûm nasa êm! Bâwng rualte chu an mangang a, hlobet hring hmun an neih loh avângin; a ni, berâm rualte chu an ṭiau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa , ka au va che; mei chuan thlalêr ram hlobet hmun chu a kâng fai ta a, mei alh chuan ram thing zawng zawng chu a kâng fai ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ni, ramsate chu nangmah ngaiin an thaw huam huam a; luitête chu a kangchat a, mei chuan thlalêr ram hlobet hmun chu a kâng fai ta si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion-ah chuan tawtawrâwt hâm ula, ka tlâng thianghlimah chuan inrâlrinna puang rawh u! He ram chhûnga mi zawng zawngte chu khûr rawh se; Lalpa ni chu a lo thleng dâwn a, a hnai tawh hle si a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thimna leh khaw durna ni, chhûm zîng leh thim chhah mup thlenna ni a ni ang a. Khawfîngchatin tlângte a tuam angin mi hrâng rual tam tak, la hmuh ngai loh, eng tik maha hmuh leh tawh ngai loh tûr an lo thawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hma lam leh hnung lam chu a kâng fai zêl a; an hmabâk ram chu Eden huan ang ni mah se an pelh hnu chuan thlalêr ram ro a ni zêl, eng mah zuah an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An lan dân chu sakawr lan dân ang a ni; sakawr chuang mi angin an tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Indona tawlailîr ri angin tlâng chungah an kai ri sup sup a, pâwl kâng alh hluah hluah ang leh indonaa mipui chak tak inpeih sa angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hmaah mipuite chu an thlaphâng a; an hmêlte chu a lo dâng vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi chak tak angin an tlân a, indo mi angin bangah an lâwn a; mahni zâwn ṭheuhvah an kal a, an tlar dân an tibuai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An innêk lo va, mahni kawngah an kal ṭheuh va; hriamhreite an su tlang a, an kal pêng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawpui chungah an zuang a; kulh chungah an tlân a; in chhûngahte an lâwn chho va, rûkru angin tukverhahte an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hmaah lei a khûr a, vânte a nghîng a; ni leh thla chu a thim a, arsiten an êng an thup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a sipai rualte hmaah a aw a chhuah a; a riah bûkte chu a ropui hle si a; a thu hlentu a chak si a; Lalpa ni chu a ropuiin a râpthlâk êm êm si a; tuin nge tuar thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Chuti chung pawhin tûnah in thinlung zawng zawngin, chaw ngheiin, ṭapin, lungngaiin ka lam lo hawi rawh u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In puan ni lovin in thinlung thlêr ula, Lalpa in Pathian lam chu hawi rawh u; ani chu khawngaih thei tak leh lainatnaa khat, thinnel leh ngilneihna ngah, chhiatna thlentîr lo tûra inlamlêt ṭhîn a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hnênah chhangphut hlan leh in tûr hlanahte pawh chuan a kîrin, rilru inlamlêtin, malsâwmna hnutchhiahin a awm lo vang tih tuin nge hria?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion-ah chuan tawtawrâwt hâm ula, chaw nghei hun serh thianghlim ula, inkhâwmpui urhsûn tak ko rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mipui khâwm ula, inkhâwmho chu tithianghlim ula, putarte, naupangte, hnute hne laite khâwm ula; mo neitu chu a pindan aṭangin lo chhuak sela, mo pawh a pindan chhûngril ata lo chhuak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puithiam, Lalpa rawngbâwltute chu hulhliap leh maichâm inkârah chuan ṭap sela, “Aw Lalpa , i mite zuah la, i rochante hi sawichhiata awm hnamten an chunga ro an rêlsak tûrin pe suh. ‘An Pathian chu khawiah nge a awm tâk?’ tiin an mipuite zîngah chuan engah nge an tih ang?” ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan a ram tan thahnem a ngai a, a mite chu a khawngaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite hnênah, “Ngai ula, in hnênah buh te, uain te, hriak te ka rawn thlen ang a, chûng chuan in tlai ang a; hnamte zîngah chuan sawichhiatin ka awmtîr tawh hauh lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, in hnên ata hmâr lam aṭanga lo kal mi hrâng rual chu ka ûm bo vek ang a, ram ro leh ṭiauvah ka kal botîr ang, a hmasa pâwl chhak lam tuipuiah, a hnuhnûng pâwl thlang lam tuifinriatah; a lo uih chhuak ang a, rimchhe takin a lo nam ang, thil râpthlâk tak a tih tâk avângin,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw, ram, hlau suh la; hlimin lâwm rawh, Lalpa chuan thil ropui takte a ti ta si a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ramsate u, hlau suh u; thlalêr hlobet hmun a lo chawr a, thing chu a lo rah a, theipui kûng leh grêp hruite chu a lo duah si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangni, Zion fate u, lâwm rawh u, Lalpa in Pathianah chuan hlim rawh u; ruah hmasa chu tâwk chiahin a pe si che u a, in tân ruah a sûrtîr a, thla khatnaa ruah hmasa leh ruah hnuhnûng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hruihte chu buhin a khat ang a, uain leh hriak khurte chu a khat liam ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“In zînga ka sipai rual tam tak ka tirh, khaukhuap te, thingngêt te, pangang te, thingngêt pangangten an ei zawh kumte kha ka rûl leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam tak in ei ang a, in tlai ang a, mak taka ngaihtuah ṭhîntu che u Lalpa in Pathian hming chu in fak ang; ka mite chu an mualpho ngai rêng rêng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Israel-te zîngah ka awm tih leh, Lalpa in Pathian ka ni a, tu mah dang an awm lo tih in hria ang. Ka mite chu an mualpho ngai reng reng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, mi zawng zawng chungah ka thlarau ka leih ang a; in fapate, in fanuten ka thu an hril ang a, in putarten mumangah an mang ang a, in tlangvâlten inlârnate an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chûng nîahte chuan ka bâwihpate, ka bâwihnute chungah pawh ka thlarau ka leih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vânah leh leiah thilmakte ka hmuhtîr ang a, thisen te, mei te, meikhu ding te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ni thimah a chang ang a, thla thisenah a chang ang, Lalpa ni ropui tak leh râpthlâk tak chu a lo thlen hmain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, tu pawh Lalpa hming lam apiang chu chhanhim an ni ang. Lalpan a sawi ang khân, tlân chhuakte chu Zion tlângah leh Jerusalem khuaah an awm ang a, a la awm chhunte zîngah chuan Lalpan a kohte chu an awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh u, chûng nîahte leh chumi hun, Juda leh Jerusalem tun din leh hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hnam zawng zawng ka khâwm ang a, Jehosaphata ruamah ka hruai thla ang. Ka mi, ka ro chan Israel chunga an thiltih avângin an chung thu ka rêl ang; ram dangah ka mite an tidarh a, ka ram an ṭhen darh bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ṭhum vâwrin ka mite an insem a; naupangte chu a hmei a pain nawhchizuar leh uain lei nân an hralh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni Tura leh Sidon, nangni Philistia ramte u, ka chungah phuba lâk in tum em ni? Ka chunga phuba lâk in tum a nih zawngin rang takin in chungah phuba ka la lêt ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tangkarua leh ka rangkachak in la a, ka thil ṭha tak duhawmte in biak in chhûngahte in keng lût ta vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda fate leh Jerusalem fate pawh an ramri aṭanga hla takah in sawn bo theih nân, Grik fapate hnênah in hralh ta mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in hralhna hmun aṭang khân chawk thovin ka chhuahtîr ang a, in thungrulhna chu in lû chung ngeiah ka thungrûl ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In fapate, in fanute chu Juda fate kutah ka hralh ang, anni chuan hla takah Seba mite hnênah anmahni an hralh ang a; Lalpa chuan a ti ta a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hei hi hnamte zîngah puang ula: “Indona buatsaih ula! Mi chakte chawk tho ula; indo mi zawng zawngte lo hnai sela, lo chho rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In leilehna hmâwr zumte chu khandaihah chher ula, in thei kûng ah chhumna chemtête chu feiah chher rawh u; mi chak lo pawhin, ‘Ka chak a ni,’ ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A vêla hnam zawng zawngte u, hmanhmawh ula, lo kal ula, pung khâwm rawh u. Aw, Lalpa , chutah chuan i mi chak takte kal chhuktîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnamte chu inchawk tho sela, Jehosaphata ruamah chuan lo kal chho rawh se; chutah chuan a vêla hnam zawng zawng chunga rorêl tûrin ka ṭhu dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An sual êm mai a, buh seng angin ât ula, a khah hma chu a khura grêp rah sâwr angin rap sâwr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi sâng tam takte chu Jehosaphata ruamah an awm khâwm ta; chutah chuan a ni Lalpa ni a lo thlen dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni leh thla te an thim a, arsiten an êng an thup a. Pathianin a mite mal a sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu Zion tlâng aṭangin a rûm hum hum ang a, Jerusalem khua aṭangin a aw a chhuah ang a; vânte leh lei an nghîng ang a; nimahsela, Lalpa chu a mite tân inhumhimna a ni ang a, Israela thlahte tân kulhbîng a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa in Pathian, ka tlâng thianghlim Zion-a chêng ka ni tih in hria ang. Tichuan, Jerusalem khua chu a thianghlim ang a, mikhual tu mah an kal tlang leh tawh hauh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, tlâng sângte chuan uain thlum a fartîr ang a, tlângte chu hnute tuiin a luang ang a, Judai ram lui tê zawng zawng chu tuiin a luang ang a; Lalpa in aṭangin tuikhur a lo chik chhuak ang a, Sitim kawr ruam a tihnâwng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda fate chunga râwng taka tia an ramah mi thiam thisen an chhuah avângin, Aigupta ram chu a ram ang a, Edom ram chu thlalêr ram ro a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judai ram erawh chu kumkhuain a awm reng ang a, Jerusalem khua pawh an luah reng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, an thisen ka tlen fai loh chu ka tlêng fai ang; Lalpa chu Zion-ah a chêng reng si a.”
  </para>
</usx>
